Got A Girl Crush On:  the ladies in this 1950s LIFE photo series  &amp;ldquo;Six Girls One Apartment&amp;rdquo;  
 While it&amp;rsquo;s currently unknown what story the photos were originally went along with, the suggestion (in the rest of the photo) of a guitar, communal dinners, and navy fatigues worn as pajamas makes me think there was many a rowdy night drinking cheap red wine and while taking turns in the bathroom getting ready to hit the next singles mixer. 
